title: 엔딩70_서은표_영문
---
<<bg 검은화면>>
(After becoming very close with EunPyo...)
(Naturally, I started visiting her studio apartment quite often.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: You're here?
(EunPyo opens the door with a bright smile.)
(EunPyo seems to truly love me.)
(It feels like she doesn't want to be apart from me for even a single moment.)
(And I don't mind that feeling at all.)
(We officially started dating during summer break,)
(And before we knew it, we're approaching our 100th day anniversary.)
{name()}: What should we watch today?
<<show pyo_idle>>
EunPyo: Well, we finished the latest episodes of 'Dol-Se-Ah-Ttae' the day before yesterday...
EunPyo: Oh, there's a new trendy anime out.
<<show pyo_shock>>
EunPyo: 'Wait! Beautiful Girls Love Me Even After Seeing My "Real Face"?' This is it.
{name()}: That title is incredibly long.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Yeah. People usually just call it by a shortened name.
(We often go on dates at her place.)
(Now, sitting glued together on the sofa watching anime has become a natural part of our routine.)
(On one side of the shelf, there are tons of photos of me and photos we took together.)
(And my belongings are scattered all over the house.)
(At this rate, I thought, wouldn't it be better if we just actually lived together...?)
(After watching anime for quite a while, I noticed EunPyo nodding off.)
{name()}: EunPyo. Want to go inside and sleep?
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: Mm-hmm. Let's go together...
{name()}: Okay.
(Just as I was about to stand up, EunPyo mumbled while leaning into my arms.)
EunPyo: {name()}...
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Do you just... want to live with me?
EunPyo: I don't want to be apart from you even for a second.
{name()}: ......
{name()}: I was actually just thinking the same thing.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Does that mean yes?
{name()}: Yeah. I'll go bring all my stuff over right now.
(EunPyo giggles.)
EunPyo: No way, do that tomorrow.
<<hide>>
<<bg 서은표_진엔딩>>
EunPyo: For now, let's just sleep together...
(And so, we officially began living together.)
(Even though we spent 24 hours a day together, we never had a single fight.)
(I don't think I'll ever find anyone else who loves me as much as EunPyo does.)
<<wait 1>>
<<end>>
===